      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ5TVgFQABBDQRglE4FYD9wo8/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJX0lYaGFnEAE",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "1 年前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "絲滑的薑味拿鐵，薑皮細膩，口感完美平衡，令人難忘！\n\n友善的服務員和咖啡師熱情地接待了我的老母親，並首先為她送上了湯和熱飲。主菜的照片也很棒——皮脆肉嫩，令人垂涎。這裡是灣仔休憩放鬆的理想選擇。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Velvety ginger latte with fine ginger zest—perfectly balanced and memorable!\nFriendly staff and barista seated my elderly mom and served soup and hot drink for her first. See the photo of main dishes—crisp skin and tender meat. Perfect place to recharge in Wanchai.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
